                       black's session types.

  backend/tools/       the read, write and edit tools and the supporting
                       machinery they share, adapted from pi's tool
                       implementations. The shell tool is deliberately not
                       among them.

  backend/tools/image/ the image pipeline, adapted from pi: type detection by
                       magic bytes, EXIF orientation, conversion and the resize
                       ladder. Uses @silvia-odwyer/photon-node, which is
                       Apache-2.0.

Everything else in black is original work.
